==Official Introduction==
> Hiyuki, a member of the Special Response Force, is the embodiment of icy purity.
The wishes entrusted to her in her brief encounters with others drive her on, carving a path forward.
> — Description from the [https://wutheringwaves.kurogames.com/m/en/main/#resonators Official Website] 

==Personality== 

==Appearance==
Hiyuki is shown to be a tall albino woman with fair skin, long white hair and eyelashes, and vibrant red eyes. She has two distinct beauty marks, a small one under her left eye and a larger one on her right shoulder.

Her [[Tacet Mark]] is located on the outer side of her upper right thigh.
